Architecture: all
Maintainer: subnetsmith <291419189+subnetsmith@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-cryptography, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: alsa-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/subnetsmith/cardputer-nearby
Description: Swap profile cards and send encrypted texts to CardputerZeros close by
 Each CardputerZero running Nearby carries a small profile card (nickname,
 colour, status, 16x16 avatar). Walk past someone else running it and you swap
 cards automatically, even with the app closed. Text anyone you have met:
 texts are end-to-end encrypted (X25519 + ChaCha20-Poly1305) with delivery
 receipts and safety codes. Cards are public; a listen-only switch hides you,
 and a Background switch makes it run only while the app is open.
